        "Content": "***This property is virtually staged to show its full potential***\r\n\r\n\r\nLWK Premium Collection\r\n\r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nMost Unique Extra Spacious 7 Bed / 6 Bath Energy Efficient Detached Family Home Of Distinction \r\n3.7 Acre Plot \r\nShort Distance From Both Kill & Straffan Villages \r\nThe K Club & Killeen Golf Club Within Close Proximity \r\nConcrete Built Home Built To Exacting Standards \r\nMost Idyllic Setting With Uninterrupted Views \r\nLarge Detached Workshop / Garage \r\nServices   \r\nMains Water and an Artesian well additional water supply\r\nPuraflo sewage system \r\nFully watered paddocks with hardcore drive access electric supply\r\n\r\nA most captivating home in an idyllic setting....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Leinster Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this breathtaking home to the Kildare Property Market. \r\n\r\nAlthough the property needs some minor internal finishing, no expense was spared in the quality of materials and craftsmanship in the construction of this wonderful home.\r\n\r\nThis is a most imposing architectural gem which must be viewed to be fully appreciated. \r\n\r\nThe extra spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance hallway, sitting room, living room with open fireplace, study, kitchen / dining / family room, utility room, guest toilet & 2 en suite bedrooms (one with walk in wardrobe).\r\n\r\nThe first floor consists of a large gallery landing, primary suite with walk in wardrobe and en suite bathroom, 2 further bedrooms (1 en suite) and family bathroom. The two reception rooms on the first floor could be used as additional living space / home offices / bedrooms.\r\n\r\nThe sitting room downstairs and the two first floor reception rooms have the option of a fireplace with a full chimney breast in place.\r\n\r\nThe second floor consists of a large converted attic offering a large self contained space.\r\n\r\nPlanning restrictions in this location make it impossible to obtain planning permission for a home of this size. The property could be further extended (subject to planning permission) to include a large leisure / recreation area / swimming pool.\r\n\r\nThe many features of this stunning home include: Bespoke Italian fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances & feature island, exquisite timber work throughout, fitted wardrobes in a number of the bedrooms, quality sanitary ware in all bathrooms and stone wall and floor tiling in all bathrooms. \r\n\r\nThe property is a most energy efficient home with solid timber aluclad double glazed windows & energy efficient central heating system. The property further boasts a hand-cut roof with timbers that are 9 inch by 2 inch making this an extremely robust structure. There is also a Beam central vacuum system. \r\n\r\nOutside the property is surrounded by 3.7 acres of grounds together with a large detached garage / workshop.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families.\r\n\r\nThis is country living at its best, however all amenities and Dublin are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe area is serviced by an excellent bus route and the M7 Motorway is within a few minutes connecting Dublin and all arterial routes.  \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• All walls are constructed with 9 inch solid blocks \r\n• Quarry stone slates to roof with aluminium fascia, gutters and down pipes. \r\n• Large stoned back yard with 50 metres by 30 meters stoned and drained area \r\n• Arena and 5 stables with store \r\n• Bordered by the Slane river\r\n• Serviced with its own artesan well and septic tank. \r\n• Land has site potential, subject to planning permission\r\n• Castle warden golf club is a 5 minute walk away\r\n• Arthur Guinness Way and grave is a 10 minute walk away\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. \r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
